Krita Nova 29 - the Line tool erases when it is used from the Eraser tool

The eraser is a tool of its own (patch 01): switching to it gives the brush
eraser mode, the eraser preset and its own size/opacity, and switching to any
other tool takes that away again. So the Line tool, switched to from the
Eraser tool (with the line tool shortcut, patch 13), drew a normal brush line.

KisPaintopBox::slotToolChanged(): the Line tool, entered from the Eraser tool,
keeps the eraser active - same preset, eraser mode, eraser size and opacity -
so it draws erasing lines, and the eraser button stays checked. Choosing any
other tool than the Line or Eraser tool ends it as before; "E" goes back to
the tool used before the eraser. The Line tool entered from the Brush tool
draws normally.
diff --git a/libs/ui/kis_paintop_box.cc b/libs/ui/kis_paintop_box.cc
index def7065..8ada2be 100644
--- a/libs/ui/kis_paintop_box.cc
+++ b/libs/ui/kis_paintop_box.cc
@@ -86,6 +86,7 @@ namespace {
 // Tool ids (defined in plugins/tools/basictools)
 const QString ERASER_TOOL_ID = QStringLiteral("KritaShape/KisToolEraser");
 const QString BRUSH_TOOL_ID  = QStringLiteral("KritaShape/KisToolBrush");
+const QString LINE_TOOL_ID   = QStringLiteral("KritaShape/KisToolLine");
 }
 
 KisPaintopBox::KisPaintopBox(KisViewManager *viewManager, QWidget *parent, const char *name)
@@ -1406,7 +1407,13 @@ void KisPaintopBox::slotToolChanged(KoCanvasController* canvas)
 
     QString  id   = m_viewManager->toolManager()->activeToolId();
 
-    const bool isEraserTool = (id == ERASER_TOOL_ID);
+    // Krita Nova (patch 29): the Line tool, switched to from the Eraser tool,
+    // draws erasing lines: the eraser stays active (same preset, eraser mode,
+    // eraser size/opacity) until another tool is chosen.
+    const bool isEraserLine = (id == LINE_TOOL_ID)
+            && (m_eraserToolActive || m_eraserLineActive);
+    const bool isEraserTool = (id == ERASER_TOOL_ID) || isEraserLine;
+    m_eraserLineActive = isEraserLine;
     if (isEraserTool != m_eraserToolActive) {
         setEraserToolActive(isEraserTool);
     }
